# The build context of the platform's images (infra/images/*.Containerfile), as an allow-list:
# whatever is not named here — .env, .data, node_modules, docs — never reaches a build.
*

# Every manifest of the workspace, so pnpm reads the same workspace the lockfile describes…
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.pnpmfile.mjs
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!tools/*/package.json

# …and the sources of the packages an image is built from.
!apps/web
!packages/api-gateway
!packages/auth
!packages/config
!packages/contracts
!packages/reports
!packages/semantic
!infra/images

# Never in an image: dependencies (installed inside the build), tests, caches, local builds, and
# the semantic layer's own Cube project (Cube runs from its image, not from the gateway's).
**/node_modules
**/test
**/.svelte-kit
**/.turbo
**/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
packages/semantic/cube
